# Black City (dark towers lit all night, shops that never shut and Trainers on every corner): a saw lead in C minor
# over a synth pad, an electric piano running in sixteenths, a pumping synth bass and a hard beat. The city never sleeps, so it
# plays the same by day and by night.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
